# Web UI

- Semantic HTML first. ARIA/keyboard only if native insufficient.
- No default `tabindex`/`role`/`aria-*` on natively-working elements.
- No wrapper `div`/`span` around a single child — use the semantic/interactive element directly, or flex/grid on the parent.

## Layout stability

No layout shift on state change. Optional adornments (badges, chips, actions): reserve fixed space always — hide with `invisible`/`opacity-0`, not `{cond && …}`. Async loading: skeleton matches final layout; no one-line stub replacing a list.
